```mermaid
graph LR
    %% Color Theme
    classDef input fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#2C3E50,stroke-width:2px,color:#111
    classDef aug fill:#F9E79F,stroke:#F39C12,stroke-width:2px,color:#111
    classDef backbone fill:#AED6F1,stroke:#2980B9,stroke-width:2px,color:#111
    classDef head fill:#ABEBC6,stroke:#27AE60,stroke-width:2px,color:#111
    classDef loss fill:#F5B7B1,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:2px,color:#111

    Input["🩻 Chest X-ray<br>Unlabeled NIH CXR"]:::input

    Input -->|View 1| Weak["🎛️ Weak Augmentation<br>Rotation · Translation"]:::aug
    Input -->|View 2| Strong["🎛️ Strong Augmentation<br>Blur · Intensity · Crop"]:::aug

    Weak --> Backbone["🧠 Xception Backbone<br>Feature Extraction"]:::backbone
    Strong --> Backbone

    Backbone -->|Features| ICH["🔀 ICH<br>Instance Head"]:::head
    Backbone -->|Features| CCH["🔀 CCH<br>Cluster Head"]:::head

    ICH --> Loss(("📉 Twin-Contrastive<br>InfoNCE Loss")):::loss
    CCH --> Loss
```
